      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-08-31T11:00:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there/will there be a recovery path?",
      "revId": "b72dc922a0cef58651be2ddaa161f3266969cd55",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b61a61f9_d12e779e",
        "filename": "microdroid_manager/src/instance.rs",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 153,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-08-31T13:43:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s on the caller (microdroid_manager in this case) to keep the data size the same. This can be achieved by reusing the buffer that read_microdroid_data returned.\n\nSo, failing to satisfy this condition is a programming error, not an error caused by external events (e.g. attack, data corruption, etc.) which we should have detected earlier while reading (and decrypting and authenticating) the data.",
      "parentUuid": "4205ca52_67d79ab7",
      "revId": "b72dc922a0cef58651be2ddaa161f3266969cd55",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fa9fdd66_616d7ffc",
        "filename": "microdroid_manager/src/instance.rs",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 168,
      "author": {
        "id": 1139038
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-08-31T11:00:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we ever write different data then we\u0027ll have reused the same IV-key pair which can be the basis for attacks on the crypto. If we\u0027re sure this will never happen, we should document how we know that. Otherwise, we should be storing a nonce with the encrypted data (e.g. [1]) that was generated at write time. It could be randomly generated (e.g. [2]) or we might be able to define a tamper-proof sequence at a later stage.\n\n[1] -- http://cs/android/system/keymaster/key_blob_utils/auth_encrypted_key_blob.cpp?l\u003d221\u0026rcl\u003d77e046ef83988b46bbcb84194c08df69c680b2c6\n[2] -- http://cs/android/system/keymaster/key_blob_utils/auth_encrypted_key_blob.cpp?l\u003d40\u0026rcl\u003d77e046ef83988b46bbcb84194c08df69c680b2c6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 168,
        "startChar": 75,
        "endLine": 168,
        "endChar": 90
      },
      "revId": "b72dc922a0cef58651be2ddaa161f3266969cd55",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cf625103_42869179",
        "filename": "microdroid_manager/src/instance.rs",
