      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-08-31T13:43:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point. The seed for nonce is now stored when writing the content and read before decrypting it. The seed is randomized.",
      "parentUuid": "fa9fdd66_616d7ffc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 168,
        "startChar": 75,
        "endLine": 168,
        "endChar": 90
      },
