      "writtenOn": "2021-08-31T13:43:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I intended to address this in a follow-up change, but let do it here.\n\nNonce is now a 64-bit counter (which is expanded to 96-bits) which is initialized from a random number. Overflow is detected by having another variable for counting the number of advances.",
